Document explicit-owner provisioning, OAuth admission/grants, service bootstrap versus user config, import/export, backup/restore for DB and encrypted OAuth/secret state, key rotation, live-edit matrix, restart/recovery, and rollback. Coordinate admin route exposure with existing security plan 1ff53bcd; preserve root/named endpoint semantics. Acceptance: fresh-install and existing-user procedures are executable and contain no secrets. Implementation/local evidence: docs/specs/remote-configuration-acceptance.md. Production and native-host verification remain separate release gates.
